1
00:00:00,019 --> 00:00:02,265
¿Cómo dices en inglés cambiar de opinión?

2
00:00:02,265 --> 00:00:04,275
Change one's mind.

3
00:00:04,469 --> 00:00:05,909
I changed my mind.

4
00:00:05,909 --> 00:00:08,661
I don't want pizza, I want tacos.

5
00:00:08,661 --> 00:00:13,377
I hope she changes her mind about
going to college that far away.

6
00:00:13,377 --> 00:00:15,547
Comprendo, mi amigo.
